# A focused slice of the Active Directory schema for the test directory.
# Real AD names (and OIDs where AD's are used), with syntaxes and matching rules
# slapd 2.4 knows, so filters such as (lastLogonTimestamp<=...) and
# (objectSid=\01\05...) work. Also the attributes behind the domain dashboard,
# password policies, trusts, replication metadata, security descriptors and
# password resets, and 389 Directory Server's nsAccountLock.
#
# dNSHostName, operatingSystemVersion, memberOf and container are compiled into
# Apple's slapd, so they are not redefined here.

